1
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:49,560
I heard this is your favorite zither.

2
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,520
I went to many places

3
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:53,450
and found many craftsmen to fix it.

4
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:55,800
Try it.

5
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,860
Thank you, Your Highness.

6
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:11,160
Your Highness, these are pastries I made myself.

7
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:11,960
Try some.

8
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,290
Thank you for fixing my zither.

9
00:02:34,079 --> 00:02:35,720
How is it? Is it good?

10
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,000
It's good.

11
00:02:39,079 --> 00:02:41,410
It's just that I don't usually eat sweets.

12
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:58,860
Your Highness?

13
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,620
These pastries...

14
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:07,320
Your Highness!

15
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,640
Yuwen Jingxuan!

16
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:12,280
Someone! Is anyone there?

17
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:13,890
Yuwen Jingxuan.

18
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:27,579
The prince needs someone by his side.

19
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:29,040
Whether he can survive

20
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:30,700
depends entirely on tonight.

21
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:45,360
What exactly went wrong?

22
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,200
Tang Zhiluo.

23
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,480
Tang Zhiluo.

24
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:30,440
Who are you?

25
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:33,400
Tang Zhiluo, the wise ruler has descended.

26
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:34,680
The stars have returned to their places.

27
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,320
Do not forget your mission.

28
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,440
Tang Zhiluo.

29
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:50,680
Tang Zhiluo.

30
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,520
Good thing I woke up and noticed something wrong.

31
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:21,800
Otherwise, I wouldn't have realized you were poisoned too.

32
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,930
Your Highness, about the pastries...

33
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:26,650
I never thought you were trying to harm me.

34
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:30,890
When you were making the pastries,

35
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:33,210
did you notice anyone suspicious?

36
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,840
Right.

37
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:41,170
The culprit was so careful.

38
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:44,320
They wouldn't let you spot them easily.

39
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:45,850
Don't worry, leave it to me.

40
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:54,080
Sixth Brother, I heard you were ill.

41
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,560
What happened to Miss Tang?

42
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,040
Is she unwell?

43
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,520
A few days ago, I sent her

44
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:05,200
safely to your mansion.

45
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:08,080
How did you take care of her?

46
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,850
Zhiluo is part of my household.

47
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,160
Third Brother, you ignore the proper business

48
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,400
of the imperial examination

49
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:20,240
and come to my mansion to meddle.

50
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:23,010
Aren't you overstepping your bounds?

51
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:25,360
Miss Tang and I are confidants.

52
00:06:25,840 --> 00:06:28,120
What do you mean by overstepping my bounds?

53
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:30,080
Miss Tang, I will take you away

54
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,680
from this murderous maniac.

55
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:36,120
Yuwen Jingxuan.

56
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:39,800
For this so-called obsession,

57
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,760
isn't it enough that you killed one person?

58
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,480
If Zhiluo stays in your mansion,

59
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:46,610
she will lose her life sooner or later.

60
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,560
You'd better shut up.

61
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,040
Lord Yu.

62
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,860
It's just a minor cold.

63
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,960
Thank you for visiting me in person, Your Highness.

64
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:07,090
I feel really bad about troubling you.

65
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,240
Is it just a cold?

66
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:09,840
Just a cold.

67
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,160
Please, Your Highnesses,

68
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,800
don't have a falling out because of me.

69
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:19,800
Miss Tang, you must think it through.

70
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:24,000
Although my martial arts are not as good as my sixth brother's,

71
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,040
if I fight to the death,

72
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:28,680
I might be able to help you escape.

73
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,720
I'm not feeling well,

74
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:36,440
so I won't see you out, Lord Yu.

75
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:38,800
Okay.

76
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:40,860
If anything else happens,

77
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,540
send me a message anytime.

78
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:46,920
Even if I have to fall out with my sixth brother,

79
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,460
I will take you out of here.

80
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,480
Are you okay?

81
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,560
Rest assured, Your Highness.

82
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,000
The poison has been cleaned up.

83
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,060
It won't be traced back to our people.

84
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:10,600
Why didn't you take Miss Tang away by force, Your Highness?

85
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:12,800
At least she could be used to keep the Prince of Shuo in check.

86
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,000
A crucial chess piece

87
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,660
must naturally be placed in a crucial position.

88
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,130
I don't understand.

89
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,620
This third brother of mine

90
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,560
is also a romantic.

91
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,410
Not to mention poisoned pastries,

92
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,490
even if Tang Zhiluo fed him knives,

93
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:31,760
he would be willing.

94
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,760
The doctor said you need to rest well.

95
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:48,020
I'll come see you again in the afternoon.

96
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:41,840
Ah, Miss.

97
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,440
Don't you watch where you're going?

98
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,900
I'm sorry, sir. I'm sorry.

99
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:47,920
Yuwen Jingxuan.

100
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:48,800
You jinx.

101
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:59,000
What a fat catch.

102
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,730
It's enough to feed me for days.

103
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,120
Sir.

104
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,040
Let's go. I'll treat you to a good meal.

105
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,040
Sir.

106
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:17,040
Could you buy me a new outfit?

107
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:20,320
Look, I've been wearing this for over ten days.

108
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,760
It stinks. Smell it.

109
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,720
Smell it.

110
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,560
Deal.

111
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:24,760
Go.

112
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:54,080
You came from beyond the Great Wall,

113
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:58,240
fleeing the war in your hometown.

114
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,440
It's better to have more money when traveling.

115
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:03,840
Take this silver for your travel expenses.

116
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:06,520
You are my benefactor.

117
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:09,160
Don't you people of the Central Plains say,

118
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,600
a drop of kindness

119
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:14,040
should be repaid by offering oneself?

120
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:16,120
There's no need for that, miss.

121
00:11:17,520 --> 00:11:18,440
I don't care.

122
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,320
You have to take me with you.

123
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,360
If you don't take me with you,

124
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,280
I'll report you to the authorities.

125
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,410
I'll say... I'll say you assaulted me.

126
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:27,760
M-Miss, you are biting the hand that feeds you.

127
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:30,000
I told you my name is Aduo.

128
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:33,800
Miss Aduo.

129
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,260
You should rest early.

130
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:03,240
Fortunately, the accounts are settled.

131
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:05,970
Otherwise, bringing such a big trouble along...

132
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,800
I hope Jingxuan is doing well.
